sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Customer
  participant SITE as Website
  participant VIEW as Loyalty View (Web or PWA)
  participant API as Loyalty App API
  participant OTP as Email OTP Service
  participant R as ROLLER
  participant P as PATCH
  participant EXT as External Events (CRUD)

  U->>SITE: Start journey: Open main website
  SITE->>VIEW: Loyalty access: Open loyalty page

  alt First-time customer enrollment
    U->>R: Enrollment action: Join loyalty program at venue or POS
    R->>P: Automation sync: Send customer profile for loyalty
    P-->>API: Customer sync: POST /webhooks/patch/contact-updated
  else Returning customer
    Note over U,VIEW: Existing customer continues to login
  end

  U->>VIEW: Login request: Enter email
  VIEW->>API: OTP request: POST /auth/otp/request
  API->>OTP: OTP send: Deliver one-time code by email
  U->>VIEW: OTP submit: Enter code
  VIEW->>API: OTP verify: POST /auth/otp/verify
  VIEW->>API: Account load: GET /account
  API-->>VIEW: Account response: Return name, contact info, stamps, upcoming bookings, waiver status, and rewards
  VIEW-->>U: Customer view: Show account details, stamp count, upcoming bookings, waiver status or document link, and rewards

  U->>R: Purchase action: Buy park tickets
  R-->>API: Checkout webhook: Send booking, ticket, and waiver data
  R->>P: Automation sync: Send booking update for loyalty calculation
  P->>P: Stamp update: Add stamps from ticket quantity (single large order can max loyalty)
  P->>P: Reward check: Create one or more unique codes when thresholds are reached
  P-->>API: Loyalty update: POST /webhooks/patch/contact-updated
  U->>VIEW: Manual refresh: Refresh loyalty page
  VIEW->>API: Account load: GET /account
  API-->>VIEW: Account response: Return updated stamps, upcoming bookings, waiver status, and available code list

  alt Booking is edited or canceled in external system
    EXT->>R: External change: Create, update, or cancel booking
    R-->>API: Booking webhook: Send updated booking, ticket, and waiver data
    R->>P: Automation sync: Send booking change
    P-->>API: Loyalty correction: POST /webhooks/patch/contact-updated
    U->>VIEW: Manual refresh: Refresh loyalty page
    VIEW->>API: Account load: GET /account
    API-->>VIEW: Account response: Return corrected booking, waiver, and loyalty status
  end

  U->>R: Redemption action: Use free-pass code at checkout
  R->>R: Checkout validation: Validate code is active and unused
  R->>R: One-time use: Mark code invalid after successful checkout
  R-->>U: Checkout result: Confirm discounted purchase

  loop Scheduled verification automation
    P->>R: Usage check: Query ROLLER Data API for used discount codes
    P-->>API: Usage sync: POST /webhooks/patch/contact-updated
  end

  U->>VIEW: Manual refresh: Refresh loyalty page
  VIEW->>API: Account load: GET /account
  API-->>VIEW: Account response: Return updated account projection and code-used status
  VIEW-->>U: Customer view: Show latest contact, stamp, booking, waiver, and reward state
